Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.44,0:02:49.44,nicks,,0,0,0,,Project coordinator at editor: {\c&HFFF4C5&} Ria_Lee
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.44,0:02:51.44,nicks,,0,0,0,,Coordinator assistant:{\c&HFFF4C5&} Martini, gaarysn
