Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.10,0:01:03.35,mga alaala,,0,0,0,,Dito sa Jeonbugwan nire-record namin ang lahat ng bituin
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.43,0:01:06.69,memories,,0,0,0,,May lumabas sa birthday mo. Gusto mo bang makita?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.77,0:01:08.44,mga alaala,,0,0,0,,Oo, tatay
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.31,0:01:10.86,mga alaala,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's go
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.41,0:01:24.66,mga alaala,,0,0,0,,Dito
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.79,0:01:31.21,voiceover,,0,0,0,,Pinag-aralan ng aking ama ang mga bituin at nagtala tungkol sa mga ito
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.21,0:01:34.67,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,Dahil isa siyang salamangkero na nagbabasa ng mga konstelasyon
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.98,0:01:48.98,mga alaala,,0,0,0,,Madam!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.06,0:01:50.23,mga alaala,,0,0,0,,Madam!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.24,0:02:02.45,mga alaala,,0,0,0,,Manatili dito at huwag umalis
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.29,0:02:06.62,mga alaala,,0,0,0,,Kapag nakita mo ang iyong ama, tumakbo ka
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.12,0:02:08.54,mga alaala,,0,0,0,,Huwag hayaang mahuli ka niya
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.15,0:02:34.48,mga alaala,,0,0,0,,Ama...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.42,0:03:33.33,mga alaala,,0,0,0,,bibigyan kita ng lakas
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.17,0:03:35.54,memories,,0,0,0,,Sasama ka ba sa akin?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.80,0:03:47.51,voiceover,,0,0,0,,Ang araw na pinatay ang aking ama ng apat na pamilyang Daeho,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.18,0:03:50.06,offscreen,,0,0,0,,Sinundan ko si Jin Moo
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.39,0:03:53.94,sa likod ng mga eksena,,0,0,0,,Ako ay pinalaki na ganap na nahiwalay sa mundo
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.02,0:03:56.82,sa likod ng mga eksena,,0,0,0,,sa malalim at mapanganib na mga lambak ng Danhyanggok
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.06,0:04:30.56,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,Ewan ko, nakaligtas ako dahil malakas ako,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.64,0:04:32.85,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,o malakas dahil nakaligtas siya
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.06,0:04:40.48,voiceover,,0,0,0,,Nang ang nakaraan ko at ang aking ama ay nakalimutan,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.44,0:04:43.65,voiceover,,0,0,0,,Nakabalik na ako sa wakas bilang Naxu
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.95,0:04:50.83,offscreen,,0,0,0,,Pero patay na si Naxu
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.54,0:04:54.75,voiceover,,0,0,0,,Bumalik ako dito bilang Moo Deok
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.75,0:04:58.17,sa likod ng mga eksena,,0,0,0,,na may walang magawang may-ari,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.92,0:05:02.38,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,na at the same time is my disinterested student
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.46,0:05:04.80,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Gaano pa ba tayo katagal?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.88,0:05:06.18,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ang pulseras na ito ay tumitimbang ng isang tonelada
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.26,0:05:08.30,general text,,0,0,0,,Guro, pagod ang estudyante mo
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.39,0:05:11.01,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Nagkaroon na ako ng sapat. Hindi na ako makakapunta
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.10,0:05:13.18,general text,,0,0,0,,Dala ko lahat ng gamit!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.27,0:05:15.89,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ako ang panginoon, at ikaw ay aking lingkod
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.98,0:05:17.23,general text,,0,0,0,,Ito ang trabaho mo
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.31,0:05:19.23,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Kung kinakailangan, ako ang iyong guro,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.77,0:05:21.53,general text,,0,0,0,,at maid, kailan mo gusto?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.61,0:05:22.65,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Siyempre
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.07,0:05:28.28,general text,,0,0,0,,Hindi ko alam,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.95,0:05:31.28,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,na mayroong ganoong lugar sa labas ng lungsod
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.37,0:05:35.08,pangkalahatang text,,0,0,0,,Napakabagsik ng lugar na ito na wala kang maririnig na echo dito
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.21,0:05:37.50,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Kaya ang pangalan, Danhyangok
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.84,0:05:44.13,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,At may narinig akong echo
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.21,0:05:45.51,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Isa lang itong figure of speech!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.59,0:05:47.01,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ang pamagat ay moronic
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.55,0:05:49.55,general text,,0,0,0,,Gusto kong kumain
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.51,0:05:53.56,general text,,0,0,0,,Tumira ako doon
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.64,0:05:55.85,general text,,0,0,0,,Kakainin mo ang dala ko
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.93,0:05:59.48,pangkalahatang text,,0,0,0,,at matulog kung saan ka matutulog pagkatapos ng mahirap na araw
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.77,0:06:04.19,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ano ito? Amoy manok
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.07,0:06:08.78,general text,,0,0,0,,- Nagtitinda ba sila ng manok dito?\N- Sinong magtitinda ng manok dito?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.62,0:06:13.79,general text,,0,0,0,,Nararamdaman mo rin naman diba?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.87,0:06:15.54,general text,,0,0,0,,Sinasabi ko sa iyo, ito ay manok
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.12,0:06:18.83,general text,,0,0,0,,Sigurado ako. Mahilig ako sa manok
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.62,0:06:21.21,general text,,0,0,0,,Paano ka nakabangon diyan?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.21,0:06:24.00,general text,,0,0,0,,May nagpiprito ng manok sa malapit
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.09,0:06:25.76,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Bumaba ka. Bakit ka pumunta dun?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.97,0:06:36.10,italics,,0,0,0,,See? manok
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.18,0:06:39.23,general text,,0,0,0,,Sabi ko sa iyo amoy niya. Ang cool dito
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.79,0:07:00.67,general text,,0,0,0,,Bakit nandito ang lahat?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.79,0:07:03.63,pangkalahatang text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.67,0:07:06.59,general text,,0,0,0,,May bathtub pa dito
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.06,0:07:16.97,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Mu Dok,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.56,0:07:21.23,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,may bundok ng pagkain at kahit isang lugar upang lumangoy
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.31,0:07:23.48,general text,,0,0,0,,Guro, maganda ang tahanan mo
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.56,0:07:25.82,general text,,0,0,0,,Kailangan ba talagang takutin ang estudyante ng ganoon?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.90,0:07:26.73,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Kakaiba...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.07,0:07:30.49,general text,,0,0,0,,At may kumot
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.49,0:07:35.03,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Sa madaling salita. Cute at komportable
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.91,0:07:37.33,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Hindi ito sa akin
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.79,0:07:40.66,general text,,0,0,0,,May nakatira dito
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.96,0:07:47.17,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.25,0:07:50.63,general text,,0,0,0,,kakain ba tayo ng manok? Nakahanda na siya
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.72,0:07:51.88,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Mu Dok?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.64,0:07:59.06,general text,,0,0,0,,Lalaki ba ito?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.66,0:08:21.96,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Halika, huminto!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.79,0:08:25.29,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Kalmado
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.72,0:08:38.72,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Good boy
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.81,0:08:40.64,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Nasanay nang husto. Dito ka ba nakatira?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.35,0:08:42.77,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Hindi ito isang ligaw na aso
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.77,0:08:45.02,general text,,0,0,0,,Nasaan ang master mo?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.85,0:08:47.81,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Hoy, mahimulmol, dalhin mo ang iyong panginoon
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.03,0:08:52.03,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ang talino ng aso
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.15,0:08:55.70,behind the scenes,,0,0,0,,Sino ito?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.78,0:08:57.24,voiceover,,0,0,0,,Hindi maaaring mga tao ni Dan Zhu ang mga ito
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.32,0:09:00.58,offscreen,,0,0,0,,Hindi sinusubukang itago o itago ng isang ito
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.25,0:09:04.33,italics,,0,0,0,,Tea
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.41,0:09:07.46,general text,,0,0,0,, Guest tayo, para mag-cup tayo, di ba?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.75,0:09:10.21,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Panoorin kung ano ang iyong kinakain at inumin
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.00,0:09:13.05,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Una kailangan nating suriin kung sino ang nakatira dito
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.13,0:09:14.92,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Pagkatapos ay magpapasya tayo kung ano ang susunod na gagawin
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.01,0:09:16.26,general text,,0,0,0,,So hindi mo talaga alam?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.89,0:09:17.72,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ano?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.80,0:09:20.10,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,May aso, bulaklak kahit saan,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.18,0:09:22.10,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,kumukulo ang manok at tsaa
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.18,0:09:23.48,general text,,0,0,0,,At muntik na akong magkamali
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.10,0:09:24.93,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ano ang pinagsasabi mo?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.02,0:09:28.31,general text,,0,0,0,,Napagpasyahan ko na sinusubukan mong agawin ako at tumira sa akin,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.40,0:09:29.86,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,nagtatago sa likod ng pagsasanay
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.94,0:09:31.73,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Kung ikakawag ng asong ito ang buntot sa harap mo,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.82,0:09:34.44,general text,,0,0,0,,I would decide na ito lang ang plano mo
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.53,0:09:36.65,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,May sapat na espasyo para sa dalawa o tatlong bata
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.36,0:09:39.24,general text,,0,0,0,,Iba ang lahat dito noong nakatira ako dito
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.82,0:09:41.20,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Walang buhay ang lugar
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.28,0:09:43.87,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,at perpekto para sa pagsasanay, kaya dinala kita dito
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.46,0:09:46.75,general text,,0,0,0,,So, training?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.08,0:09:49.46,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ito lang ang nasa isip mo?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.17,0:09:52.59,pangkalahatang text,,0,0,0,,Kalimutan mo na! Kumain at uminom ng gusto mo, sige
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.67,0:09:53.80,general text,,0,0,0,,Hayaan mo silang patayin ka
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.63,0:09:56.47,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Tama
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.55,0:10:00.22,general text,,0,0,0,,Hindi ko akalain na ganoon ang magiging reaksyon niya sa isang simpleng biro.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.30,0:10:03.47,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Kasalanan ko ang pagsunod sa kanya sa ilang na ito
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.06,0:10:05.02,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Walang salita
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.69,0:10:15.57,mga alaala na italics,,0,0,0,,Manatiling isang walang alam na tagapagmana
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.07,0:10:19.78,mga alaala,,0,0,0,,Chan family
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.66,0:10:22.99,general text,,0,0,0,,Mas gugustuhin kong manatili dito,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.24,0:10:25.66,general text,,0,0,0,,paano ako mamumuhay ng ganito
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.21,0:11:13.84,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ngayon ang pinuno ng Jinyeowon
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.92,0:11:16.75,general text,,0,0,0,,convened the magicians of Deho at the Unified Council
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.30,0:11:20.76,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Nandoon ang lahat ng 11 pamilya maliban kay Chang Gan
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.84,0:11:24.76,general text,,0,0,0,,Ang laban ko kay Chan Wook ay isang malaking kaganapan?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.35,0:11:27.77,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ito ay isang tunggalian sa pagitan ng mga salamangkero at ng maharlikang pamilya
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.85,0:11:29.64,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ang huli ay daan-daang taon na ang nakalipas
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.73,0:11:32.27,general text,,0,0,0,,Sinisikap ko lang parusahan si Chan Wook
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.35,0:11:34.44,pangkalahatang text,,0,0,0,,para sa mababang pagtingin sa akin
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.52,0:11:35.90,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Hindi ito mga personal na marka
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.77,0:11:39.53,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Nag-utos ang Kanyang Kamahalan at nagtipon ang mga salamangkero
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.61,0:11:43.28,general text,,0,0,0,,Kung sumang-ayon sila, isang opisyal na tunggalian ang magaganap
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.07,0:11:47.58,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,May lumitaw na puwang na sumira sa katatagan at kapayapaan,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.45,0:11:50.87,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,, umiral sa pagitan ng palasyo at ng mga salamangkero
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.97,0:12:08.14,general text,,0,0,0,,Sumasang-ayon ka ba sa desisyon na bawian si Wook ng kanyang mga karapatan para maging susunod na Gwangju?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.35,0:12:10.73,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Oo, totoo
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.40,0:12:16.77,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,, Duel lang
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.86,0:12:19.40,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,mareresolba ang hindi pagkakaunawaan sa pagitan ng Crown Prince at Uk
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.48,0:12:20.74,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,At patungkol sa Gwangju
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.61,0:12:26.12,general text,,0,0,0,,Mayroon na akong kandidato na gusto kong i-nominate
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.20,0:12:28.03,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ang pagtakas ay hindi katumbas ng pagkatalo
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.24,0:12:32.41,general text,,0,0,0,,Narinig kong tumakas siya bago inanunsyo ang laban
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.62,0:12:36.00,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Nakakahiya
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.08,0:12:39.50,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Dapat siyang lumaban ng tapat at mamatay nang may dignidad, tulad ng isang salamangkero
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.59,0:12:41.84,pangkalahatang text,,0,0,0,,Walang lakas ng loob si Chan Wook para dito
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.26,0:12:46.18,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Lahat narito ay kanyang guro
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.26,0:12:48.89,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,- Oo\N- Hindi siya nakilala sa talento
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.97,0:12:52.48,general text,,0,0,0,,Tutol ako sa mga salamangkero na pinapahiya ng ganyan
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.56,0:12:55.23,general text,,0,0,0,,Paano kung ipagkait natin kay Chan Wook ang pagiging magician niya?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.52,0:13:01.99,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Kung magkakaisa nating ipagkait sa kanya ang katayuang ito,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.07,0:13:05.32,general text,,0,0,0,,kailangan mong kunin ang lahat ng lakas niya, mawawalan siya ng kapangyarihan
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.41,0:13:08.12,general text,,0,0,0,,Ipapanukala mo bang sirain ang buong buhay ng isang binata?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.20,0:13:10.03,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ngunit makakatulong ito sa pagharap sa laban
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.95,0:13:15.21,italics,,0,0,0,,Anyway, sarado ang gate ng energy niya dahil sa tatay niya.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.29,0:13:17.21,general text,,0,0,0,,- Tama siya\N- There is a point
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.29,0:13:19.38,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Bawat isa sa inyo
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.46,0:13:22.59,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,ay guro ni Uka
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.72,0:13:27.34,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Paano ka nakakapag-usap nang walang ingat
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.43,0:13:30.56,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,tungkol sa pagkasira ng buhay ng isang taong dati mong estudyante?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.47,0:13:35.69,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Tinanggap ni Sosnovy Bor ang mga tuntunin ng palasyo
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.77,0:13:38.69,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Atin sa ating sarili ang kahihiyan na maaaring mahulog o hindi
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.27,0:13:42.86,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Kung gayon, hayaan itong maging opisyal na tunggalian sa pagitan ni Sosnovy Bor at ng palasyo
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.69,0:13:45.53,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Oo
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.95,0:13:49.99,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Narinig kong na-master ni Uk si Ryusu sa napakaikling panahon
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.99,0:13:53.58,general text,,0,0,0,,May nagturo ba sa kanya mula sa kagubatan?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.25,0:14:00.63,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Hindi mahalaga kung saan siya pumunta, kanino,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.30,0:14:05.92,general text,,0,0,0,,walang guro para sa kanya
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.47,0:14:12.97,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ang tubig ay kaaya-aya at malinis. Ang balat ay naging mas malambot
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.06,0:14:14.35,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Marahil ito ay mineral
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.02,0:14:18.69,general text,,0,0,0,,Mu Dok, ang may-ari ng bahay ay napakaayos na tao
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.77,0:14:20.27,general text,,0,0,0,,Sa tingin ko hindi na siya babalik...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.78,0:14:24.82,pangkalahatang text,,0,0,0,,Heto
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.37,0:14:40.88,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Himbing na natutulog
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.50,0:14:43.13,italics,,0,0,0,,Syempre pagod ka
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.21,0:14:45.84,general text,,0,0,0,,Mahinahon na sana kaming maglakad, pero nagmamadali ka
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.92,0:14:48.88,general text,,0,0,0,,Ikaw na ngayon si Moo Dok, hindi si Nak Soo. Wala kang sapat na lakas
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.85,0:14:55.22,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Paano...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.06,0:14:57.10,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Mabigat
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.18,0:14:58.73,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Tanga
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.81,0:15:01.69,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Kung ito ay napakahirap, dapat kang humingi ng tulong
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.57,0:15:11.03,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Napakalambot
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.58,0:15:18.58,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ako ang may-ari,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.25,0:15:21.75,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,at siya ay isang alipin. tama yan
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.17,0:15:24.96,general text,,0,0,0,,Dapat dito ako matulog
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.06,0:15:40.77,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,, Kahit papaano hindi ako komportable
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.32,0:15:51.36,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.58,0:16:05.67,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Guro,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.75,0:16:07.17,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,magandang gabi
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.94,0:16:33.40,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Gaano kahirap
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.77,0:17:04.23,general text,,0,0,0,,Sabi mo may nomad sa loob?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.90,0:17:09.48,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Gaano kainteresante
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.34,0:17:39.55,general text,,0,0,0,,Kung wala ang tulong mo, hindi ko siya makikilala,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.64,0:17:41.22,general text,,0,0,0,,dahil walang malisya sa kanyang kaluluwa
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.06,0:17:50.15,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Mas mabuti pang mamatay ka sa aking mga kamay kaysa maging ligaw at mapahamak
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.05,0:18:20.76,sa likod ng mga eksena,,0,0,0,,May kamangha-manghang kaluluwa sa katawan na ito
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.10,0:18:26.48,voiceover,,0,0,0,, Dapat ay naging ligaw na siya ngayon, kung iisipin kung gaano kahina ang katawan na ito.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.56,0:18:28.48,voiceover,,0,0,0,,Bakit okay pa rin siya?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.44,0:18:40.16,voiceover,,0,0,0,,Wala akong nararamdamang energy. Saan siya nawala lahat?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.16,0:18:47.58,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Sino ka?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.67,0:18:51.46,general text,,0,0,0,,At sino ka?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.54,0:18:53.54,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Lumayo sa Moo Dok
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.43,0:20:31.39,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ang espadang ito ay ibinigay ng hari ng Gwangju Jeonbugwan
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.98,0:20:33.27,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Sino ka?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.10,0:20:36.11,general text,,0,0,0,,Ano ang ginagawa mo sa tabi ng ganyang babae?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.32,0:20:41.24,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok, tumakbo ka!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.45,0:22:10.91,pangkalahatang text,,0,0,0,,Sa wakas nagising
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.50,0:22:16.54,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Sino ito?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.62,0:22:17.92,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Taong Kahapon
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.29,0:22:20.54,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Lalaki kahapon?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.63,0:22:21.84,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Oo. hindi mo maalala?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.59,0:22:27.84,memories italics,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok, tumakbo ka!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.09,0:23:05.88,italics,,0,0,0,,Ikinalulungkot ko ang kahapon
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.96,0:23:07.80,general text,,0,0,0,,May nakita akong tao sa bahay,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.88,0:23:10.89,general text,,0,0,0,,at bigla kang bumunot ng espada, wala akong choice
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.97,0:23:12.30,general text,,0,0,0,,Oo, natakot ako sa sarili ko
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.39,0:23:14.97,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Hindi ko pa rin kontrolado ang enerhiya sa aking kamay
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.06,0:23:16.93,general text,,0,0,0,,Hindi ko gustong masaktan ka
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.02,0:23:18.14,general text,,0,0,0,,Kayong dalawa...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.06,0:23:20.02,general text,,0,0,0,,nakipaglaban?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.94,0:23:26.15,general text,,0,0,0,,Wala ka talagang maalala?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.40,0:23:28.61,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Hindi
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.69,0:23:31.24,general text,,0,0,0,,Nakatayo ka doon at nakatingin sa amin
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.32,0:23:32.57,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ako?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.66,0:23:33.53,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ano?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.16,0:23:35.91,general text,,0,0,0,,I think you're sleepwalking
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.99,0:23:39.58,general text,,0,0,0,,bibigyan kita ng mga halamang gamot para dito. Magtimpla ng tsaa at uminom
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.21,0:23:41.67,general text,,0,0,0,,Healler ka ba?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.75,0:23:43.83,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Hindi, ngunit narito siya upang mangolekta ng ilang halamang gamot,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.92,0:23:45.54,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,na dito lang makikita
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.63,0:23:46.55,general text,,0,0,0,,Call me Master Li
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.13,0:23:49.30,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,May sapat na espasyo para sa amin,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.38,0:23:51.26,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,gawin ang iyong sarili sa bahay
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.64,0:23:56.18,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Okay, Sapsari
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.47,0:23:59.85,italics,,0,0,0,,Hindi mo talaga maalala?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.93,0:24:01.94,italics,,0,0,0,,Naglakad ba talaga ako sa aking pagtulog?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.95,0:24:17.20,italics,,0,0,0,,Nakahiga ako sa sahig...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.28,0:24:19.75,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,, Espesyal ang nomad na ito
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.83,0:24:23.04,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Isang espesyal na kaluluwa sa gayong mahinang katawan
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.33,0:24:27.29,general text,,0,0,0,,Kilalanin pa natin siya
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.38,0:24:28.84,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Huwag magsinungaling
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.92,0:24:31.51,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,, Seryoso! Inilipat kita para mas komportable kang matulog
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.59,0:24:32.97,general text,,0,0,0,,Ano ang relasyon niyo?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.72,0:24:35.93,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Kasal?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.01,0:24:37.22,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,- Hindi\N- Hindi
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.18,0:24:41.35,general text,,0,0,0,,Hindi ako nakatulog sa kama. Nakahiga ako sa sahig
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.43,0:24:43.48,general text,,0,0,0,,Bakit ako magsisinungaling? ako talaga...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.56,0:24:44.85,italics,,0,0,0,,- Lagi kang nagsisinungaling\N{\i0}- Siguradong kasal
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.77,0:24:46.94,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,- Hindi naman\N- Hindi naman
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.52,0:24:49.11,general text,,0,0,0,,Nanalo ka ba?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.19,0:24:50.73,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Hindi, nawala. Pero...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.61,0:24:52.99,general text,,0,0,0,,Napakalakas niya
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.07,0:24:55.28,general text,,0,0,0,,- Siya...\N- Ang swerte mo. alam ko na
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.36,0:24:56.41,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ano?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.74,0:25:04.12,general text,,0,0,0,,Nagtipon pa sila ng council. Nagiging kumplikado na ang mga bagay
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.21,0:25:07.54,general text,,0,0,0,,Sa tingin mo okay lang sina Wook at Moo Deok?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.63,0:25:10.30,general text,,0,0,0,,Pumunta sila sa Sari, ang home village ng Mu Dok
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.38,0:25:11.55,general text,,0,0,0,,Siya ay masaya, sa palagay ko
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.38,0:25:14.97,general text,,0,0,0,,Bakit siya dapat maging masaya?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.05,0:25:16.18,general text,,0,0,0,,Kailangan ka niyang iwan
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.26,0:25:18.51,pangkalahatang text,,0,0,0,,- At?\N - Idiot ka
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.60,0:25:20.51,pangkalahatang text,,0,0,0,,In love si Moo Dok sa iyo
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.14,0:25:24.52,general text,,0,0,0,,Sabi niya,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.44,0:25:26.77,pangkalahatang text,,0,0,0,,upang matulungan si Uku
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.85,0:25:28.56,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Oo, oo, siyempre
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.57,0:25:34.49,general text,,0,0,0,,Narinig kong tumakas si Mr. Chan
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.57,0:25:38.70,general text,,0,0,0,,Hindi siya tumakas, nagtago lang siya sa ngayon
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.78,0:25:40.24,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ano ang pagkakaiba?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.33,0:25:43.00,general text,,0,0,0,,So pumunta siya sa Danhyangok kasama si Mu Dok?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.87,0:25:46.96,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,- Danhyangok?\N- Oo
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.04,0:25:50.42,general text,,0,0,0,,Nagpaputok siya kamakailan doon sa utos ng master
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.50,0:25:53.09,pangkalahatang text,,0,0,0,,Naaalala ko na nakita ko sila
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.17,0:25:56.26,general text,,0,0,0,,Nalaman ko na pumunta sila dun kasi malapit lang.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.34,0:25:59.01,general text,,0,0,0,,- Tama ba ako?\N- Hindi
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.09,0:26:01.97,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Mu Dok kasama si Uk sa nayon ng Sari
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.06,0:26:04.06,general text,,0,0,0,,Ah, I see. Sari
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.14,0:26:06.27,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Huwag sabihin kahit kanino na nandiyan si Uk
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.85,0:26:08.52,general text,,0,0,0,,Okay, hindi ko sasabihin
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.60,0:26:09.73,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Bon appetit
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.90,0:26:14.23,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Mu Dok sa Danhyangok?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.32,0:26:15.82,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Napakadelikado ng lugar
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.90,0:26:18.24,general text,,0,0,0,,Iningatan mo ba ang iyong ibon doon?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.95,0:26:20.99,general text,,0,0,0,,Napilipit mo ang iyong bukung-bukong doon at tinakot ang lahat
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.95,0:26:23.37,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Oo, sa Danhyangok
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.54,0:26:27.71,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Nakalimutan ko ang lahat tungkol sa lugar na ito
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.39,0:26:42.51,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Mahinang apoy
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.56,0:26:50.19,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Punong-puno ng enerhiya ang kanyang katawan, kung isasaalang-alang ang kanyang lakas
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.19,0:26:54.90,general text,,0,0,0,,Siya ang master ng Chipsu
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.53,0:26:57.90,pangkalahatang text,,0,0,0,,Chips? Kaya siya kasing lakas ko
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.99,0:27:00.36,general text,,0,0,0,,Malinaw kung bakit napakahirap talunin siya
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.92,0:27:12.08,italics,,0,0,0,,Gumagamit siya ng enerhiya upang mapanatili ang apoy
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.17,0:27:13.25,general text,,0,0,0,,Naka-move on na siya,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.17,0:27:15.30,pangkalahatang text,,0,0,0,,kaysa kay Ryusu
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.01,0:27:18.97,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ryusu?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.09,0:27:22.72,general text,,0,0,0,,Mas malakas siya sa akin. Baka masaktan ako ng husto
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.02,0:27:29.77,general text,,0,0,0,,Nabasa ng ulan ang damit ko
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.83,0:27:53.00,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ito si Chisu
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.79,0:27:55.71,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Natuyo niya ang kanyang damit nang napakadali
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.79,0:27:58.42,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ito ang pinakamataas na antas ng Chisu
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.22,0:28:06.85,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Pinakamataas na degree?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.14,0:28:09.60,general text,,0,0,0,,Puwede na akong mamatay
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.23,0:28:14.77,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Tuyo na ngayon
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.78,0:28:25.12,italics,,0,0,0,,Huwag uminom ng tsaang ito
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.87,0:28:31.37,general text,,0,0,0,,Nainom mo na ba lahat?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.46,0:28:32.46,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Oo
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.54,0:28:34.63,general text,,0,0,0,,Okay ka lang? May masakit ba?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.25,0:28:38.30,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ito ba ay isang lason na sabaw?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.21,0:28:40.59,italics,,0,0,0,,Hindi, siyempre
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.67,0:28:41.97,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Broth decoction
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.05,0:28:43.30,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Prutnyak?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.38,0:28:44.64,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Twig decoction?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.22,0:28:48.26,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Nagsalita ka tungkol sa mga halamang gamot na tumutubo lamang sa Danhyangok
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.35,0:28:49.68,general text,,0,0,0,,Twigs ba ang pinag-uusapan mo?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.98,0:28:53.81,general text,,0,0,0,,Alam mo ba ang tungkol sa kanya?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.89,0:28:56.86,general text,,0,0,0,,Narinig ko na umiinom ang mga magician ng ganitong klaseng tsaa...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.94,0:29:00.28,general text,,0,0,0,,Ibinaba niya ang libido at mahinahon silang nagsanay
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.69,0:29:03.36,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Libido? Ano ito?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.20,0:29:06.99,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Karnal na pagnanasa, isa sa limang pangangailangan ng tao
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.07,0:29:08.58,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Carnal...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.29,0:29:13.37,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Prutnyak lowers...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.87,0:29:18.09,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,enerhiya na nagiging sanhi ng pagnanasang ito
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.30,0:29:23.09,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Narinig ko ang tungkol sa isang salamangkero na umabot sa mataas na antas ng pangkukulam
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.17,0:29:25.80,general text,,0,0,0,,Nagtagumpay siya dahil ibinaba niya ang kanyang libido at bumuti
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.88,0:29:29.05,italics,,0,0,0,,Sinasuot lang daw niya ang damit na gawa sa tela ng abaka,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.14,0:29:32.35,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,kaya pala binansagan si Master Li na "Master Hemp Li"
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.43,0:29:36.14,general text,,0,0,0,,At matalino ka para sa isang simpleng alipin
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.77,0:29:41.98,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Isang karangalan para sa akin na makatagpo ang isang salamangkero ng ganoong antas
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.53,0:29:44.49,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Pagbati, Master HempLi
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.12,0:29:54.08,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Host,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.16,0:29:56.08,general text,,0,0,0,,bakit ka nakaupo? Kamustahin
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.21,0:30:02.50,general text,,0,0,0,,So... medyo pareho na ang libido ko?..
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.88,0:30:05.01,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Hindi...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.09,0:30:06.09,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Hindi...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.17,0:30:07.72,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ngunit hindi ito...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.43,0:30:10.35,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Hindi ito maaaring. Tulungan mo ako
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.18,0:30:13.93,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Hindi sapat ang isang takure para dito
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.02,0:30:15.85,general text,,0,0,0,,Sigurado ka ba? Sabihin mo sa akin ang totoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.93,0:30:17.94,italics,,0,0,0,,Totoo. Kung nag-aalala ka,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.02,0:30:20.48,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Magtitimpla ako ng isa pang tsaa na ibabalik ang lahat sa lugar
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.44,0:30:25.07,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Salamat
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.15,0:30:26.15,italics,,0,0,0,,Master Li
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.24,0:30:28.99,general text,,0,0,0,,Maaari mo bang tulungan ang aking panginoon?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.07,0:30:33.45,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Naipon ang kanyang enerhiya sa kanyang kanang kamay at hindi niya ito makontrol.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.54,0:30:37.46,general text,,0,0,0,,Maaari mo ba siyang turuan kung paano makayanan kahit papaano?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.54,0:30:39.21,general text,,0,0,0,,Hindi ito magiging mahirap na turuan siya
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.29,0:30:42.25,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Pero! Para matuto sa akin kailangan mong sundin lahat ng sasabihin ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.34,0:30:43.55,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Handa na para dito?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.63,0:30:45.05,italics,,0,0,0,,Handa siya sa kahit ano
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.13,0:30:46.05,general text,,0,0,0,,Talaga?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.59,0:30:51.35,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ano nga ba ang kailangan kong gawin?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.43,0:30:52.55,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Tulad ko
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.35,0:30:54.77,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,uminom ng isang decoction ng mga sanga
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.06,0:30:58.48,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Handa nang mag-downgrade
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.15,0:31:02.23,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,libido?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.82,0:31:08.45,general text,,0,0,0,,Naubos mo na ba ang laman ng buong kettle?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.95,0:31:09.95,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Oo
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.91,0:31:12.12,general text,,0,0,0,,Kaya mo ba?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.04,0:31:26.30,general text,,0,0,0,,So what if isa siyang sikat na magician?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.38,0:31:30.09,general text,,0,0,0,,Wala siyang estudyante, at tumatambay siya dito sa hindi malamang dahilan
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.93,0:31:33.18,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Sa tulong nito, magiging mas mabilis ang lahat
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.68,0:31:36.43,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Magagawa mong kontrolin ang enerhiya sa iyong kanang kamay
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.52,0:31:40.10,general text,,0,0,0,,Uy, gusto niyang inumin ko itong chastity tea. Ano ang punto?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.19,0:31:44.65,general text,,0,0,0,,Nag-aalala na ako sa dami ng nainom ko kahapon
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.73,0:31:47.15,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Duda ako na sapat ang tsaang ito para maibalik ang lahat
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.23,0:31:49.07,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ito ay may katuturan
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.20,0:31:52.16,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Hindi masamang ideya
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.24,0:31:55.62,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ngayon hindi mo na kailangan ng tumaas na libido
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.71,0:32:03.00,general text,,0,0,0,,So, for some time I won't have any desires?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.96,0:32:06.96,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok, tingnan mo ako sa mga mata at sabihin mo sa akin
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.05,0:32:08.55,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Oo! At ano?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.63,0:32:10.59,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Isipin mo ang iyong sarili. Ito ay isang bihirang pagkakataon
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.67,0:32:12.88,general text,,0,0,0,,Hindi lahat ng tanga ay mapalad na makatagpo ng isang tulad niya
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.93,0:32:15.55,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Kaunting pagpigil
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.60,0:32:17.60,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,at tanggalin ito
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.68,0:32:20.18,general text,,0,0,0,,Hindi ito lakad sa garden, huwag mo akong pakialaman dito!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.27,0:32:22.31,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ang Celibacy ay isang hindi gaanong sakripisyo para sa isang mataas na antas ng salamangkero
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.39,0:32:24.19,general text,,0,0,0,,Makinig ka lang!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.27,0:32:26.73,general text,,0,0,0,,Wala kang pakialam kahit sirain ko ang lahat para sa sarili ko doon forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.82,0:32:28.28,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Itigil ang paggawa ng mga bundok mula sa mga molehills!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.36,0:32:30.40,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Importante sa akin, hindi alintana kung gagamitin ko man ito o hindi!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.62,0:32:43.17,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.25,0:32:45.96,general text,,0,0,0,,Hoy Moo Deok, okay ka lang?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.54,0:32:48.59,general text,,0,0,0,,Ano ang nangyari?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.63,0:32:50.55,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ryusu
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.84,0:32:55.26,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ang enerhiya ay tumagas mula sa iyo
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.76,0:32:59.18,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Kaunting lakas at napakalaking lakas
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.77,0:33:02.81,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Kung tinanggal mo ang pulseras at ginamit ang lahat ng iyong lakas,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.89,0:33:04.69,pangkalahatang text,,0,0,0,,Mamamatay ako on the spot
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.44,0:33:09.90,general text,,0,0,0,,Hoy, dinudugo ka...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.32,0:33:14.32,general text,,0,0,0,,Guro, baliw ka na talaga
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.40,0:33:16.41,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,- Gusto mo ba ang ideya na maaari akong mamatay?\N- Oo
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.49,0:33:19.41,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ito ay nangangahulugan na ikaw ay nagiging mas malakas
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.00,0:33:26.37,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ngayon ay tila hindi gaanong mahalaga,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.46,0:33:29.67,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,ngunit sa lalong madaling panahon magkakaroon ka ng mas maraming enerhiya
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.46,0:33:33.84,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,at ang iyong lakas ay magiging kasing kahanga-hanga ng Gyeongjeongdaeho Lake
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.97,0:33:38.39,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Kung gayon maibabalik ko rin ang aking lakas
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.28,0:33:55.36,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Punasan ang dugo sa iyong noo bago ito bumaha sa Gyeongjeongdaeho
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.78,0:33:59.62,general text,,0,0,0,,Masakit ba?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.70,0:34:01.33,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Hindi naman
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.41,0:34:02.91,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Itigil ang pagiging matapang
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.79,0:34:09.71,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ang unang taon ng paghahari ni Haring Go San
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.79,0:34:12.17,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Araw ng Abril
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.72,0:34:20.05,mga inskripsiyon,,0,0,0,,Go San, unang taon, ika-1 ng Abril
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.14,0:34:23.60,mga alaala na italics,,0,0,0,,Ang Bituin ng Hari ay nagliwanag sa kalangitan sa gabi sa kaarawan ng batang lalaki
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.68,0:34:26.31,mga alaala,,0,0,0,,Walang dapat makaalam nito
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.39,0:34:28.90,memories,,0,0,0,,Pero si Jeongbugwan malamang gumawa ng recording
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.98,0:34:31.31,mga alaala,,0,0,0,,Inalis ko doon ang totoong sign
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.40,0:34:32.73,mga alaala,,0,0,0,,Sa Jeonbugwan
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.86,0:34:35.49,mga alaala,,0,0,0,,pekeng walang bituin
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.11,0:34:41.32,mga alaala na italics,,0,0,0,,Huwag ipaalam sa sinuman ang sikreto ng kanyang kapanganakan
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.95,0:34:48.54,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Nakakita ng kakaibang konstelasyon?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.42,0:35:01.51,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Kaarawan ni Wook at pagkamatay ni Lady Do Hwa
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.26,0:35:05.93,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Narinig ko ang tungkol sa payo
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.89,0:35:11.44,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ang lahat ng mga marangal na salamangkero ay nagtipon dahil sa akin
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.23,0:35:15.53,italics,,0,0,0,,Gwangju Deputy,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.32,0:35:18.15,italics,,0,0,0,,bakit hindi mo simulan ang iyong genealogy?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.20,0:35:21.99,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Sa pamamagitan ng iisang boto,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.07,0:35:26.66,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,maaaring kilalanin ka rin bilang isang kagalang-galang na salamangkero
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.37,0:35:32.79,general text,,0,0,0,,Ako ay mula sa Jin clan. Jinyeowon ang lugar kung saan ako ipinanganak
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.84,0:35:37.71,general text,,0,0,0,,Ano ang nagdala sa iyo kay Jeonbugwan?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.80,0:35:39.30,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ang nomad na natagpuan sa Sosnovy Bor,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.38,0:35:41.59,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,ay isang astrologo mula kay Jeonbugwan
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.34,0:35:44.76,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Nagsimula ng imbestigasyon ang mga mago ng Chongjingak,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.47,0:35:46.68,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,magbigay ng tulong
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.39,0:35:49.35,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Anong imbestigasyon?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.11,0:35:58.03,general text,,0,0,0,,At kung sasabihin ko ba sa iyo, itatago mo ba ang lahat ng ebidensya?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.07,0:36:03.62,general text,,0,0,0,,Wala akong itinatago
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.70,0:36:05.58,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Maaari silang dumating anumang oras
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.95,0:36:09.66,general text,,0,0,0,,Nandito na sila
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.15,0:36:35.94,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Dapat mayroon itong mago
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.02,0:36:38.98,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,patuloy na pinapanatili ang kinakailangang dami ng enerhiya dito
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.03,0:36:42.70,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Siya ang may pananagutan sa lugar na ito
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.45,0:36:54.67,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ano? Katawan sa Jeonbugwan?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.75,0:36:57.96,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Inilabas ni Eunuch Kim ang lahat ng kanyang lakas, katawan sa isang lihim na silid
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.73,0:37:15.10,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Walang espesyal sa kanyang trabaho
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.19,0:37:18.27,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Isang pangungusap lamang para sa lihim na pagtingin sa mga palatandaan ng konstelasyon
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.65,0:37:22.69,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Tito
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.78,0:37:27.16,general text,,0,0,0,,Maraming scientist ang nawala dito
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.24,0:37:28.62,general text,,0,0,0,,Saan kaya sila nawala?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.37,0:37:37.00,pangkalahatang text,,0,0,0,,Salamat sa iyong tulong
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.67,0:37:39.09,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Walang espesyal
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.17,0:37:41.42,general text,,0,0,0,,May isa pa akong hiling
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.30,0:37:43.92,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Marahil ito ay sobra na,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.72,0:37:48.26,general text,,0,0,0,,pero gusto kong tingnan ang secret room ni Jeonbugwan
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.03,0:38:07.91,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Maaari kang tumingin sa paligid
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.27,0:38:36.98,mga alaala na italics,,0,0,0,,Dalhin ang katawan sa underground passage
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.20,0:38:52.12,memories italics,,0,0,0,,Kung may itinatago sila, susubukan nilang tanggalin
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.95,0:38:54.58,mga alaala na italics,,0,0,0,,Panoorin ang kanyang mga tao
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.67,0:38:59.87,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Mas mabilis
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.26,0:39:15.18,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Nakita namin kung paano umalis ang cart na ito kay Jeonbugwan
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.27,0:39:17.06,general text,,0,0,0,,Mga salamangkero ba kayo?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.14,0:39:18.27,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ipakita ang mga mukha
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.35,0:39:19.56,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Gusto naming makita kung ano ang nasa loob
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.19,0:40:04.11,general text,,0,0,0,,Kunin natin siya
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.20,0:40:53.74,general text,,0,0,0,,Tumakas ang lalaki
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.11,0:40:56.66,general text,,0,0,0,,Nawala mo na ba ito?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.87,0:41:00.16,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Nasa loob ito
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.79,0:41:02.25,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Spirit Amulet
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.12,0:41:05.21,general text,,0,0,0,,Galing ba sila sa Sosnovy Bor?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.68,0:41:23.89,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,May isang spirit amulet sa cart
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.98,0:41:26.06,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Walang mga tanong na dapat lumabas
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.06,0:41:29.65,general text,,0,0,0,,Tinulungan kami ni Nak Su kahit namatay
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.15,0:41:36.20,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Paumanhin sa mga paghihirap, Deputy Gwangju
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.91,0:41:43.75,general text,,0,0,0,,Inatake mo ang isang lalaki sa gitna ng kalye?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.83,0:41:46.67,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Inilipat ko ang walang kwentang kaluluwa mo sa isang karapat-dapat na katawan,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.75,0:41:48.13,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,ngunit wala kang karapatang magpakitang-gilas
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.21,0:41:49.38,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Paumanhin
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.05,0:42:00.14,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ihatid itong dibdib
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.31,0:42:05.48,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Siguraduhing nasa tamang kamay ito
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.56,0:42:08.81,general text,,0,0,0,,ako na agad ang bahala
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.49,0:42:21.41,general text,,0,0,0,,Panahon na para tanggalin siya
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.49,0:42:23.20,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Hanapin ako ng isa pang eunuch
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.29,0:42:27.37,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,O ililipat ko ang iyong kaluluwa sa kanyang katawan
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.38,0:42:32.05,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Sa katawan ng isang eunuch?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.96,0:42:35.72,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ano? ayaw nito?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.55,0:42:40.85,general text,,0,0,0,,susunod ako sa utos mo
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.93,0:42:44.02,general text,,0,0,0,,Dala mo pa rin ba ang Reflector?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.10,0:42:45.02,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Oo
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.65,0:42:57.07,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Iniisip ko ang pag-iwas sa paglipat ng mga kaluluwa dahil kay Sosnovy Bor
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.82,0:43:02.99,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ngunit, tila, ito ang tanging paraan upang maglingkod sa Kanyang Kamahalan
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.71,0:43:12.09,italics,,0,0,0,,Ang Sosnovy Bor amulet ay natagpuan sa isang kakaibang kariton,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.17,0:43:14.25,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,na umalis kay Jeonbugwan
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.34,0:43:17.22,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ngayon wala na tayong karapatang maghanap ng kahit ano doon
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.30,0:43:20.18,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Alamin kung kaninong agimat ito
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.76,0:43:24.72,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Tandaan, nawala si Uk sa kanyang
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.31,0:43:28.73,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,At sa paghusga sa sunog na markang ito, ito ang kanyang anting-anting
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.10,0:43:31.40,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,ang anting-anting ni Uka?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.48,0:43:35.61,general text,,0,0,0,,Isipin mo na lang, nakatakas siya, pero dumadating pa rin sa atin ang mga problema.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.69,0:43:37.44,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Hanapin ang Uka
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.53,0:43:41.45,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Alamin kung paano at saan niya ito nawala
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.28,0:43:43.57,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,- Oo\N- Oo
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.41,0:44:26.70,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ito ay mula kay Jin Moo, ang kinatawan ni Jeonbugwan
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.67,0:44:39.80,general text,,0,0,0,,Ano ang paulit-ulit niyang ipinapadala sa iyo?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.55,0:44:43.84,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ito ay mga halamang gamot para sa aking kalusugan
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.85,0:44:49.14,general text,,0,0,0,,Hindi mo masasabi sa kanya, pero napaka-caring niya
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.11,0:45:05.03,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.11,0:45:07.70,general text,,0,0,0,,Sasama ako kay Master Li para mangolekta ng mga halamang gamot
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.78,0:45:08.83,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,At pagsasanay?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.91,0:45:11.83,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Kailangan kong magbayad para sa nilalaman. See you later
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.91,0:45:13.29,general text,,0,0,0,,- Tara na\N- Oo
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.37,0:45:15.96,general text,,0,0,0,,Napakaganda ba talaga doon?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.04,0:45:18.84,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,- Kamangha-manghang\N- Sana makita ko ito sa lalong madaling panahon
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.18,0:45:26.55,general text,,0,0,0,,Master Li, napakatalino mo
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.64,0:45:29.43,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Binibili ko lahat at idinagdag ko ito. Hawakan mo
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.51,0:45:30.56,general text,,0,0,0,,- So?\N- Oo
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.89,0:45:36.06,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Mahusay
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.65,0:45:41.36,general text,,0,0,0,,Pupunta tayo ngayon kung saan maraming tangerines*
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.65,0:45:41.36,notes,,0,0,0,,*Chinese snapper
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.44,0:45:44.70,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,, Tangerines? Kunin natin ang kailangan natin at maghanda ng nilagang isda
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.78,0:45:46.11,general text,,0,0,0,,Kaya mo ba?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.20,0:45:48.16,general text,,0,0,0,,Hindi, pero tuturuan mo ako
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.08,0:45:50.91,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ano ang problema mo...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.13,0:46:03.26,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Over salted
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.97,0:46:07.64,pangkalahatang text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok, subukan
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.22,0:46:11.10,general text,,0,0,0,,Guro, nandito ka ba para harapin ang kalokohan?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.18,0:46:12.93,general text,,0,0,0,,Anong ginagawa mo?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.72,0:46:15.89,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,May matututunan mula kay Master Li
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.98,0:46:17.40,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Sino ang humihiling sa iyo na matutunan ito?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.48,0:46:19.48,general text,,0,0,0,,Kung natuto ka sa kanya, matuto ng tama!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.31,0:46:22.86,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok, I think I'm perfect for this kind of life
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.94,0:46:24.57,general text,,0,0,0,,Salamat sa paghatid sa akin
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.65,0:46:26.24,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,sa napakagandang lugar
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.82,0:46:29.99,pangkalahatang text,,0,0,0,,Hindi ka nag-aalala
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.12,0:46:34.20,general text,,0,0,0,,dahil sa tunggalian sa prinsipe?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.62,0:46:37.67,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Kung labis kang nag-aalala, alamin mo ito sa iyong sarili
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.63,0:46:40.58,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Siguradong oversalted
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.75,0:46:44.67,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Hoy!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.56,0:46:57.77,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok, ibaba mo ang kutsilyo
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.73,0:47:00.65,general text,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare throw it at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.23,0:47:03.36,general text,,0,0,0,,sabi ko papatayin kita kung wala kang silbi
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.48,0:47:05.57,general text,,0,0,0,,Hindi mo ako mapapatay
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.65,0:47:07.82,general text,,0,0,0,,Nakabisado ko ang Chipsu, at ikaw lang si Moo Dok
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.74,0:47:11.45,general text,,0,0,0,,Hindi ka na Nak Soo
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.12,0:47:15.79,general text,,0,0,0,,Hoy, sinabi ko na sa iyo!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.50,0:47:19.33,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ikaw at ako ay hindi nangangailangan ng kapayapaan at katahimikan
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.42,0:47:20.62,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,wasak ko ang mundo mo
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.13,0:47:28.51,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ano ang nangyayari sa iyo?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.59,0:47:30.72,general text,,0,0,0,,Bakit mo ako pinipigilan na mamuhay ng mapayapa?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.80,0:47:32.68,general text,,0,0,0,,Masaya ka ba sa ganitong uri ng buhay?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.93,0:47:34.81,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Oo!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.89,0:47:37.81,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ganap. Kung hindi mo gusto, umalis ka
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.89,0:47:39.81,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Gusto kong manirahan dito,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.89,0:47:42.86,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,at maaari kang umalis kung ikaw ay laban dito
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.19,0:47:46.53,pangkalahatang text,,0,0,0,,Bastard
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.57,0:47:49.74,general text,,0,0,0,,Alam mo na tayo ay konektado ng tadhana
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.28,0:47:52.53,general text,,0,0,0,,At gusto mong tapusin ko ang lahat
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.37,0:47:55.66,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,, Duwag
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.90,0:48:28.69,general text,,0,0,0,,Nakahanap ako ng paraan para kay Uka
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.78,0:48:32.49,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,iwasan ang tunggalian at maging gwangju ni Jeonbugwan
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.49,0:48:36.20,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Alin? Handa kami sa anumang bagay
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.58,0:48:41.83,general text,,0,0,0,,Hayaan mo siyang pakasalan ang anak kong si Cho Young
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.59,0:48:52.05,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,May anting-anting ang aming pamilya na magpapahintulot
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.13,0:48:53.97,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,tanggihan ang utos ng hari
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.06,0:49:01.64,general text,,0,0,0,,Maari pa nating ibagsak ang hari,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.73,0:49:05.06,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,kung lahat ng mga mage ng Deho ay bumoto para dito
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.02,0:49:09.86,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ang agimat na ito ay ipinagkatiwala sa amin ng Unified Council
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.94,0:49:14.49,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,upang maiwasan ang pagtakas ng masasamang espiritu na tinatakan sa Jinyeowon
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.07,0:49:19.79,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Iminungkahi mong kanselahin ang utos ng hari na tanggalin si Uka ng kanyang mga karapatan
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.37,0:49:21.75,general text,,0,0,0,,be the next Gwangju?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.83,0:49:24.29,general text,,0,0,0,,Oo, pero kung pakakasalan lang niya ang anak ko
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.92,0:49:26.79,pangkalahatang text,,0,0,0,,at sasali sa pamilya Jin
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.59,0:49:34.30,general text,,0,0,0,,Ngunit minsan sina Mrs. Jin at Mr. Wook
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.43,0:49:38.30,general text,,0,0,0,,nasira na ang engagement. Hindi ba ito problema?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.72,0:49:41.93,general text,,0,0,0,,Hindi dahil lumipas na ang nararamdaman ko para sa kanya
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.60,0:49:45.02,general text,,0,0,0,,gusto ko pa ring pakasalan si Uka
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.40,0:49:51.73,general text,,0,0,0,,Hindi ko akalain na ikakasal siya ng maaga
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.82,0:49:53.90,general text,,0,0,0,,At hindi ako sigurado na handa na siyang magpakasal
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.66,0:50:06.58,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Mabuti ang ginagawa mo para sa anak ng isang mayaman
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.67,0:50:09.79,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Kapag nasasabik ako sa isang bagay, mabilis akong natututo
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.88,0:50:11.09,general text,,0,0,0,,Ngayon mas gusto na kita
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.76,0:50:15.38,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Muling isaalang-alang ang iyong pagnanais na maging aking estudyante
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.38,0:50:19.43,general text,,0,0,0,,Guro, wala ka bang estudyante?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.14,0:50:22.89,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,May isa,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.97,0:50:24.98,general text,,0,0,0,,pero tinalikuran niya ang kabaklaan at nagpakasal
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.94,0:50:28.85,general text,,0,0,0,,Nagtatrabaho siya sa isang ospital ngayon
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.53,0:50:38.86,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Maaari mong baguhin ang iyong isip at tumanggi anumang oras
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.95,0:50:40.07,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Pag-isipan mo
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.95,0:50:44.20,general text,,0,0,0,,Hindi ako pumunta dito para sa training
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.29,0:50:46.08,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Gusto mo bang gugulin ang kapangyarihang ito
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.16,0:50:48.83,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,pangingisda at pangongolekta ng mga halamang gamot?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.09,0:50:57.05,general text,,0,0,0,,- Hindi ko pa rin siya kontrolado\N- Oo?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.72,0:51:00.22,general text,,0,0,0,,Magiging pabigat ang kamay na ito kung iiwan mo ito ng ganito
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.89,0:51:03.64,general text,,0,0,0,,Gusto mo bang kunin ko lahat ng lakas?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.60,0:51:08.69,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Kung gayon maaari kang mamuhay ng ordinaryong buhay
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.70,0:51:26.45,general text,,0,0,0,,Pupunta ako sa lungsod. Sasama ka sa akin?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.54,0:51:29.46,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Hindi, hindi ngayon. Kailangan kong magluto ng Moo Deok para makakain
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.67,0:51:33.71,general text,,0,0,0,,Wala siya dito. Kamakailan lang ay bumaba siya ng bundok
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.92,0:51:36.05,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ano?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.13,0:51:38.97,italics,,0,0,0,,Henyo lang si Chan Wook
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.05,0:51:41.34,italics,,0,0,0,,Kabisado na niya si Ryusu
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.43,0:51:44.01,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,at nagsasanay nang husto para sa laban
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.14,0:51:48.56,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Hayaan ang ganitong bulung-bulungan na kumalat sa buong lungsod
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.64,0:51:49.69,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Seryoso?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.39,0:51:53.15,general text,,0,0,0,,Kung hindi siya sumipot, tuluyan na siyang mawawalan ng mukha
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.19,0:51:57.32,general text,,0,0,0,,So at least mapapahiya siya
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.03,0:51:59.28,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Bigyan mo ako ng manok
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.36,0:52:01.95,pangkalahatang text,,0,0,0,,Umalis ngayon. Narito ang mga tao ng Jeonbugwan
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.03,0:52:03.99,italics,,0,0,0,,May dumating na mahalagang tao ngayon
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.08,0:52:06.79,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Mas mabuting huwag kang makialam sa kanya,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.87,0:52:08.41,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,lalo na pagkatapos ng kwentong may anting-anting
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.39,0:52:30.27,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Halika, huminto!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.44,0:52:37.69,general text,,0,0,0,,Ikaw ba ang kasambahay ni Chan Wook?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.78,0:52:40.57,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Oo. At ano?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.36,0:52:44.78,voiceover,,0,0,0,,Hinding-hindi ililipat ni Nak Soo ang kanyang kaluluwa sa ganoong katawan
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.95,0:52:46.99,italics,,0,0,0,,Hoy ikaw
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.66,0:52:51.04,general text,,0,0,0,,Naalala mo ba nung nagkita tayo sa inn sa tabi ng pier?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.05,0:53:02.84,general text,,0,0,0,,Hindi ko rin alam
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.97,0:53:08.26,offscreen,,0,0,0,,Pinaghihinalaan niya ako
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.39,0:53:12.35,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Gusto kong magtanong sa iyo ng ilang katanungan. Sumama ka sa amin sa Jeonbugwan
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.77,0:53:16.81,italics,,0,0,0,,Tara na
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.90,0:53:18.98,general text,,0,0,0,,- Let me go\N- Tumayo ka
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.07,0:53:20.48,general text,,0,0,0,,- Bakit ka...\N- Tumigil ka
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.90,0:53:24.03,offscreen,,0,0,0,,Wala siyang asul na marka
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.57,0:53:27.45,voiceover,,0,0,0,,Tama siya, di ba Nak Soo?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.37,0:53:32.58,general text,,0,0,0,,Hindi ko alam kung nasaan ang master
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.13,0:53:37.33,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Your Highness
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.21,0:53:42.42,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Your Highness
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.55,0:53:45.22,general text,,0,0,0,,Your Highness, it's me
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.30,0:53:46.68,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ako ito, Won Mu Deok
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.31,0:54:00.73,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ikaw si Won Mu Deok
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.82,0:54:04.24,pangkalahatang text,,0,0,0,,Oo, ako ito. Binigyan mo ako ng pangalang ito
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.32,0:54:05.86,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ako si Won Mu Deok
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.07,0:54:10.95,general text,,0,0,0,,Your Highness, please help me
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.03,0:54:12.16,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Sa ano?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.75,0:54:15.87,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Kamahalan, hindi ka lang matalino, kundi napakalakas
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.96,0:54:18.21,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,At ang aking panginoon, sa kabaligtaran, ay hangal at nakakaawa
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.29,0:54:20.09,general text,,0,0,0,,Dahil sa kanya, nanganganib ang buhay ko
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.17,0:54:21.92,italics,,0,0,0,,Tulungan mo ako
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.43,0:54:30.97,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Maraming salamat, Kamahalan
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.06,0:54:35.89,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ano ang ginagawa ng iyong hangal at kaawa-awang amo?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.98,0:54:38.19,general text,,0,0,0,,Iiyak lang siya araw-araw
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.27,0:54:41.32,general text,,0,0,0,,Takot na takot siya sa iyo kaya nanginginig siya sa takot
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.40,0:54:43.15,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,at umiiyak ng palihim
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.94,0:54:46.82,pangkalahatang text,,0,0,0,,Nakikita kong nagsasalita ka ng masama tungkol sa kanya para pasayahin ako
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.74,0:54:51.24,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Masasabi kong mas masahol pa kung ito ay nagpapasaya sa iyo
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.41,0:54:56.00,general text,,0,0,0,,Won Moo Deok, dapat isipin mong nakakaawa ako
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.58,0:54:58.50,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Hindi mo ako binigyan ng pangalang ito nang walang kabuluhan
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.08,0:55:02.38,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Masasabi mo sa akin ang lahat ng gusto mo, ngunit hindi mo magawa,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.46,0:55:04.21,general text,,0,0,0,,dahil natatakot silang magmukhang kaawa-awa
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.38,0:55:07.67,general text,,0,0,0,,Gusto mo bang maging verbal cesspool?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.76,0:55:10.51,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ito ay napakataas na pamagat para sa akin
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.59,0:55:12.39,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ngunit ito ay isang karangalan para sa akin
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.47,0:55:16.81,general text,,0,0,0,,Hindi kita kailangan para mapawi ang tensyon
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.48,0:55:21.48,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Kamahalan, sapat na ang iyong nagawa,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.56,0:55:24.98,general text,,0,0,0,,pero hindi mo ba mautusan ang mga taong iyon na huwag akong kunin?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.65,0:55:27.11,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Sapat na ang babala
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.04,0:55:36.37,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Kunin ito
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.83,0:55:39.04,italics,,0,0,0,,Ito ang aking sachet
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.12,0:55:40.29,notes,,0,0,0,,Sachet - isang papel o fabric pad (bag) na may maluwag na mabangong laman
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.37,0:55:43.67,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ipakita ito kung ang iyong kaawa-awang amo ay muling magdadala sa iyo sa gulo
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.63,0:55:47.01,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Maraming salamat
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.97,0:55:54.81,general text,,0,0,0,,Amoy cinnamon siya
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.89,0:55:56.68,general text,,0,0,0,,Bakit ganyan ang mukha mo?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.77,0:55:58.85,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ano? ayaw mo ba?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.93,0:56:01.48,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Hindi, gusto ko ito
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.19,0:56:03.69,pangkalahatang text,,0,0,0,,- Kung hindi mo gusto, ibalik {\i1}\N- Hindi
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.77,0:56:05.82,general text,,0,0,0,,Dumihan ko na ito sa sarili ko
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.15,0:56:09.86,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Nagpapasalamat ako sa iyo para sa magandang amoy na regalo
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.78,0:56:14.91,pangkalahatang text,,0,0,0,,Hayaan mong buhusan kita ng inumin na kasing amoy
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.17,0:56:26.59,italics,,0,0,0,,Ito ay alak na may cinnamon at luya
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.67,0:56:27.96,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Maraming cinnamon
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.05,0:56:32.55,general text,,0,0,0,,Marahil hindi mo ito gusto. Ibalik ang sachet
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.18,0:56:34.18,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Hindi
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.26,0:56:35.47,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Like
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.56,0:56:47.86,general text,,0,0,0,,- Masarap?\N- Sobrang
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.94,0:56:48.90,pangkalahatang text,,0,0,0,,Uminom pa
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.99,0:56:59.87,general text,,0,0,0,,Si Moo Dok ay malamang na pumunta sa Chwisong-ru. Wala na siyang ibang mapupuntahan
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.41,0:57:02.16,general text,,0,0,0,,Nagalit ba siya at umalis?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.25,0:57:04.83,general text,,0,0,0,,Anong klaseng maid ito?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.50,0:57:07.13,general text,,0,0,0,,Hindi lang siya isang utusan
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.75,0:57:11.09,general text,,0,0,0,,Kung hindi lang siya utusan, sino?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.01,0:57:14.43,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Mu Dok ay parang itlog
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.51,0:57:16.14,general text,,0,0,0,,Siya ay dapat protektahan
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.14,0:57:19.72,italics,,0,0,0,,- Tara tingnan natin\N- Anong meron?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.81,0:57:21.93,italics,,0,0,0,,Nakita nila ang bangkay ng isang nomad
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.02,0:57:23.81,italics,,0,0,0,,- Ang bangkay ng nomad?\N- Saan?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.77,0:57:29.57,italics,,0,0,0,,- Tingnan ko\N- Anong nangyari?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.65,0:57:31.44,italics,,0,0,0,,- Holy Heaven\N- Horror
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.53,0:57:34.36,italics,,0,0,0,,Bangungot
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.28,0:57:40.29,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Hindi ito nomad
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.37,0:57:42.29,general text,,0,0,0,,Ngunit namatay siya dahil sa kanya
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.00,0:57:44.50,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Alam mo ba ang tungkol sa mga nomad?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.58,0:57:47.13,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Kapag nawala ang isip ng mga nomad, sinisipsip nila ang enerhiya ng mga tao
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.71,0:57:49.67,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Iyon ang dahilan kung bakit ipinagbabawal ang alchemy ng mga kaluluwa,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.75,0:57:52.13,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,at nagsimulang mahuli at mapatay ang mga nomad
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.68,0:58:05.60,general text,,0,0,0,,Nasisiraan na ba sila ng bait?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.69,0:58:07.94,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,, Tanging ang mga hindi nagsasalita ng Hwansu
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.65,0:58:11.82,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Maaabot ba ng isang tao ang ganoong antas?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.90,0:58:13.11,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Siyempre
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.99,0:58:17.28,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Gusto mo bang maging estudyante ko at maabot ang antas na ito?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.86,0:58:20.49,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Hindi ka lang matalino at maganda ang pagkakagawa,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.58,0:58:22.45,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,nasa iyo ang lahat ng kailangan mo para dito
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.37,0:58:26.79,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Salamat sa papuri, ngunit ayaw kong sumumpa ng kabaklaan
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.87,0:58:28.08,general text,,0,0,0,,Kung magiging estudyante kita,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.17,0:58:30.67,general text,,0,0,0,,Tutulungan kitang tanggalin itong pulseras
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.25,0:58:32.34,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,"Guro"
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.92,0:58:34.76,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ulitin
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.67,0:58:37.59,pangkalahatang text,,0,0,0,,Itigil mo na ang panghihikayat sa akin
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.18,0:58:40.68,italics,,0,0,0,,We are from Jeonbugwan, make way
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.81,0:58:45.68,general text,,0,0,0,,Kailangan ko ng umalis. Hindi ako makaalis sa paningin nila
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.53,0:59:02.28,italics,,0,0,0,,Tingnan mo doon
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.37,0:59:03.91,italics,,0,0,0,,- Rainbow ba ito?\N- Saan?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.99,0:59:06.62,italics,,0,0,0,,Ito ay isang bahaghari
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.71,0:59:09.04,italics,,0,0,0,,- It's really a rainbow\N- Beauty
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.12,0:59:12.21,italics,,0,0,0,,- Look\N- Gaano na siya katagal nawala
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.38,0:59:14.76,italics,,0,0,0,,- Beauty\N- Tingnan mo
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.84,0:59:17.13,italics,,0,0,0,,- Isa talaga itong bahaghari{\i0}\N- Saan napunta ang kariton?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.13,0:59:19.72,italics,,0,0,0,,Nandito siya isang minuto ang nakalipas
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.26,0:59:23.06,italics,,0,0,0,,- Saan siya nagpunta?\N- Nasaan ang cart?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.58,0:59:55.17,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Nakakamangha pakinggan ang iyong echo sa Danhyangok
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.05,0:59:58.17,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Mahusay
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.13,1:00:04.22,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ano? Lasing ba si Moo Deok?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.30,1:00:06.35,general text,,0,0,0,,Sabi mo umiinom siya dito?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.43,1:00:08.60,general text,,0,0,0,,Muntik na nila siyang dalhin sa Jeonbugwan ngayon
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.56,1:00:12.56,general text,,0,0,0,,Pero, buti na lang, nailigtas siya ng Crown Prince
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.90,1:00:16.36,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,- Crown Prince?{\i1}\N- Oo
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.44,1:00:18.15,general text,,0,0,0,,Magaling siyang magpatawa
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.24,1:00:19.82,italics,,0,0,0,,Nakahanap siya ng lumapit sa kanya
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.90,1:00:22.82,general text,,0,0,0,,Ininom niya lahat ng basong inaalok nito sa kanya
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.04,1:00:28.95,general text,,0,0,0,,Nasaan siya?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.77,1:00:59.69,pangkalahatang text,,0,0,0,,Drunk as hell
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.82,1:01:02.86,general text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok, okay ka lang?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.45,1:01:09.37,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Estudyante ko, pumunta ka para sa akin
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.25,1:01:13.75,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Oo, dumating ako para sa iyo, guro
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.04,1:01:17.79,general text,,0,0,0,,Hindi ko kontrolado ang aking katawan
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.38,1:01:20.46,general text,,0,0,0,,Hindi ko man lang mahawakan ang ulo ko ng tuwid
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.01,1:01:24.13,general text,,0,0,0,,Hindi ito nangyari dati, kahit gaano ako nainom
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.84,1:01:27.80,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Hindi ka na isang bihasang mandirigma,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.93,1:01:30.10,general text,,0,0,0,,pero Moo Dok lang
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.36,1:01:39.94,general text,,0,0,0,,Hindi man lang ako makainom
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.25,1:02:03.88,general text,,0,0,0,,Gusto kong iwanan ang lahat at mamuhay ng tahimik
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.72,1:02:08.30,pangkalahatang text,,0,0,0,,Ngunit may bumabagabag sa akin
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.79,1:02:37.37,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Akala ko nahulog ako mula sa mataas na taas
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.08,1:02:40.96,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ngunit sa palagay ko ay hindi ganoon kataas
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.51,1:02:51.93,memories,,0,0,0,,Mukhang nabali ang binti ko
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.51,1:02:53.72,mga alaala,,0,0,0,,Tulungan mo ako
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.47,1:02:58.31,mga alaala,,0,0,0,,Nakita kong ginamit mo ito para tawagan ang iyong ibon
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.73,1:03:02.02,memories italics,,0,0,0,,Gusto ko rin subukan
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.11,1:03:04.53,mga alaala,,0,0,0,,Maaari ko ba ito?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.96,1:03:21.79,general text,,0,0,0,,Naparito ako para ibalik ito sa iyo
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.91,1:03:55.49,italics,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.78,1:03:56.95,general text,,0,0,0,,Nakita ko si Moo Dok
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.24,1:04:03.74,italics,,0,0,0,,Nandito talaga siya
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.83,1:04:05.66,italics,,0,0,0,,Nasaan ang Uk?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.45,1:04:07.91,italics,,0,0,0,,Sabi ko wag kang tatakbo
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.92,1:04:11.25,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ano ito?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.33,1:04:12.54,general text,,0,0,0,,Bakit ka nandito?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.63,1:04:14.55,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Hindi ka namin nakita sa nayon ng Sari,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.63,1:04:17.13,general text,,0,0,0,,kaya pumunta kami dito para hanapin ka
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.72,1:04:19.80,italics,,0,0,0,,Tama si Ju Wol, nandito ka talaga
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.88,1:04:22.30,general text,,0,0,0,,Kumusta ka, Moo Deok?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.26,1:04:24.43,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.00,1:04:52.96,pangkalahatang text,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok, malamang natutuwa kang makita kami
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.34,1:04:57.30,pangkalahatang text,,0,0,0,,Lasing siya
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.42,1:05:00.05,general text,,0,0,0,,Nakainom ba siya?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.13,1:05:01.68,pangkalahatang text,,0,0,0,,- Oo{\i1}\N- Saw
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.26,1:05:03.60,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Tulungan siyang bumangon
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.18,1:05:05.18,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Palakihin siya
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.98,1:05:17.40,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Dati pumunta si Mu Dok sa Danhyangk para mangolekta ng mga halamang gamot
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.48,1:05:20.70,general text,,0,0,0,,Dito nakatira si Master Li, pinayagan niya kaming tumigil dito
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.78,1:05:23.16,general text,,0,0,0,,Hindi ako makapaniwalang nalasing mag-isa si Moo Deok
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.24,1:05:24.57,italics,,0,0,0,,Buhay siya ng maayos
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.24,1:05:27.33,general text,,0,0,0,,Hindi ko alam na may ganoong lugar sa Danhyangok
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.95,1:05:29.33,general text,,0,0,0,,Alam mo ba ang tungkol kay Danhyangok?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.41,1:05:31.58,general text,,0,0,0,,Madalas siyang pumunta dito
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.66,1:05:34.54,pangkalahatang text,,0,0,0,,Nakuha niya ito para sa patuloy na pagtakas
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.63,1:05:35.71,italics,,0,0,0,,Yul?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.21,1:05:38.34,italics,,0,0,0,,Nabaliw siya sa mga ibon
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.42,1:05:40.88,general text,,0,0,0,,Bakit ka pumunta dito mag-isa?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.97,1:05:42.47,general text,,0,0,0,,Sakit mo pa ang paa mo dito
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.09,1:05:46.72,general text,,0,0,0,,Dahil gusto ko silang makita
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.43,1:05:53.35,general text,,0,0,0,,Wala akong pakialam sa putol na binti
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.40,1:05:56.23,general text,,0,0,0,,At hindi ako natakot na pagalitan nila ako
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.65,1:06:01.49,general text,,0,0,0,,mahal na mahal ko sila
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.67,1:06:19.13,italics,,0,0,0,,Mahilig talaga siya sa mga ibon
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.96,1:06:22.76,general text,,0,0,0,,Nga pala, anong klaseng tsaa ito?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.84,1:06:25.51,general text,,0,0,0,,- Napakasarap ng amoy\N- Nainom mo ba?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.93,1:06:30.06,general text,,0,0,0,,Oo, pero ano? Kapaki-pakinabang ba siya?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.06,1:06:31.93,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Siyempre
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.02,1:06:34.02,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ito ay ginawa mula sa mga halamang gamot,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.10,1:06:36.52,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,na lumalaki lamang sa Danhyangok
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.60,1:06:37.69,general text,,0,0,0,,Talaga?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.77,1:06:39.86,general text,,0,0,0,,- Yul, subukan mo rin...\N- Wag kang uminom...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.36,1:06:41.40,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Okay, tulungan mo ang iyong sarili
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.48,1:06:43.74,general text,,0,0,0,,- Ang sarap talaga ng amoy\N- Tell me?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.20,1:06:47.78,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ito ang chastity tea
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.20,1:06:50.24,italics,,0,0,0,,Ano? Kalinisan?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.33,1:06:52.91,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Hindi mo magagawang...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.62,1:06:57.54,general text,,0,0,0,,- Buttercup tea ba ito?\N- Hindi ko alam eksakto
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.21,1:06:59.25,italics,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.34,1:07:02.26,general text,,0,0,0,,Maraming iba't ibang halamang gamot, pwede mong inumin
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.05,1:07:05.05,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Masarap
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.76,1:07:10.26,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Para sa iyong kalusugan
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.46,1:07:43.67,general text,,0,0,0,,Isang grupo ng mga kahina-hinalang lalaki at ang aking anting-anting?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.26,1:07:45.13,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Oo
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.21,1:07:47.13,italics,,0,0,0,,Nawalan ka na ba talaga ng anting-anting?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.22,1:07:49.55,general text,,0,0,0,,May nagnakaw ba sa iyo o pinahiram mo ito sa isang tao?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.64,1:07:51.85,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Hindi, nawala ko ito
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.93,1:07:54.47,general text,,0,0,0,,Naaalala mo ba kung saan at kailan ito nangyari?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.31,1:07:57.14,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Hindi
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.23,1:07:59.73,general text,,0,0,0,,Nahanap namin siya noong iniimbestigahan namin ang kaso ng mga nomad
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.81,1:08:01.65,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Napakahalaga at mapanganib nito
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.66,1:08:13.03,italics,,0,0,0,,Kasal ni Jin Jo Young at Chan Wook?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.62,1:08:16.16,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Kahanga-hangang ideya
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.25,1:08:20.46,general text,,0,0,0,,Ngunit ang mag-asawa ay dapat magmahalan
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.54,1:08:24.25,general text,,0,0,0,,Hindi siya pwedeng magpakasal sa taong hindi niya mahal para lang malutas ang problema
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.34,1:08:28.22,general text,,0,0,0,,Sino ang magsasalita tungkol sa pag-ibig! Sa buong buhay ko, para akong malungkot na puno sa bukid. pareho!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.09,1:08:31.80,pangkalahatang text,,0,0,0,,Hindi biro ang kasal
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.89,1:08:33.43,general text,,0,0,0,,Naramdaman ko rin ang pagmamahal
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.51,1:08:34.60,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Noong unang panahon
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.68,1:08:38.35,general text,,0,0,0,,Tumalikod ako kay master dahil sa pag-ibig
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.43,1:08:40.98,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,At lahat ng ito ay walang kabuluhan
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.06,1:08:42.19,general text,,0,0,0,,Bilisan na natin
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.98,1:08:43.94,pangkalahatang text,,0,0,0,,pagpapakasal sa kanila
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.36,1:08:51.11,general text,,0,0,0,,Isang hindi kilalang tao ang sumisira sa aming harang at pumasok
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.83,1:08:59.29,general text,,0,0,0,,Ho Yeom, lumabas ka at kumustahin
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.37,1:09:03.17,pangkalahatang text,,0,0,0,,Sino ang nangahas na tawagin ako sa pangalan?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.96,1:09:09.01,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Yom
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.26,1:09:11.59,general text,,0,0,0,,Kumusta ka?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.64,1:09:13.55,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Guro...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.39,1:09:15.43,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Guro
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.14,1:09:17.18,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Guro!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.72,1:09:19.73,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Guro...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.81,1:09:21.77,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ang aking guro
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.94,1:09:26.82,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ibaba ang iyong mga espada! Ngayon na!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.55,1:09:50.72,italics,,0,0,0,,Moo Dok
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.51,1:09:54.30,general text,,0,0,0,,Akala ko natutulog ka. Hinanap kung saan-saan
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.39,1:09:56.22,general text,,0,0,0,,Lasing ka pa ba?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.93,1:09:59.52,pangkalahatang text,,0,0,0,,Akala ng lasing ay makakaakyat ako dito
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.64,1:10:04.15,general text,,0,0,0,,Pero mataas dito. I think I'm coming to my senses
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.81,1:10:07.77,general text,,0,0,0,,Iyan ba ang puno na may pugad sa itaas?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.86,1:10:08.90,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Oo
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.36,1:10:12.40,general text,,0,0,0,,Gusto kong umakyat muli sa punong ito
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.78,1:10:17.20,general text,,0,0,0,,Nakaakyat ka ba talaga sa pinakatuktok?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.41,1:10:20.16,general text,,0,0,0,,Nak Soo ako noon
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.79,1:10:24.75,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Ang buwan mula roon ay sadyang hindi kapani-paniwala
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.00,1:10:28.29,general text,,0,0,0,,Pero hindi ko na siya makikita
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.42,1:10:32.51,general text,,0,0,0,,Nakasalubong ko ang lalaking si Dan Zhu ngayon
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.17,1:10:34.68,general text,,0,0,0,,Mukhang pinaghinalaan niya ako
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.59,1:10:38.30,general text,,0,0,0,,Binigyan mo ba sila ng spirit amulet ko?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.39,1:10:40.60,pangkalahatang text,,0,0,0,,Sinubukan kong gamitin ito para bumalik
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.39,1:10:44.06,general text,,0,0,0,,Pero pinatay niya yung napagkamalan niyang ako
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.06,1:10:49.11,general text,,0,0,0,,Kung mahuli nila ako,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.02,1:10:51.36,pangkalahatang text,,0,0,0,,huwag mo akong subukang iligtas
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.40,1:10:55.49,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Siyempre. Masyado akong mahina kahit papaano
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.82,1:11:00.58,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Walang magagawa ang iyong estudyante para sa iyo
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.12,1:11:05.50,general text,,0,0,0,,Wala akong inaasahan
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.21,1:11:10.29,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Mu Dok,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.96,1:11:13.88,general text,,0,0,0,,Wala akong masyadong magawa, pero kaya kong umakyat ng puno
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.76,1:11:17.55,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Walang mga sanga sa itaas na tatayuan
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.55,1:11:20.60,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Dapat tayong gumamit ng enerhiya upang lumikha ng isang foothold
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.22,1:11:23.68,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Para dito kailangan mong makabisado ang Chisa
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.31,1:11:26.02,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Pinaalagaan mo ito tulad ng buwan
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.10,1:11:27.90,general text,,0,0,0,,Wala akong gustong gawin,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.69,1:11:30.52,general text,,0,0,0,,pero gusto kong umakyat sa punong ito
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.95,1:11:38.74,general text,,0,0,0,,Sabi mo gusto mong tumingin sa buwan mula roon
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.82,1:11:40.99,general text,,0,0,0,,Ako lang ang makakatulong dito,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.58,1:11:42.99,general text,,0,0,0,,kaya susubukan ko
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.04,1:11:45.62,general text,,0,0,0,,Gusto mo bang umakyat?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.71,1:11:50.67,general text,,0,0,0,,Kailangan nating master si Chisa, sabi ko na nga ba
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.38,1:11:53.92,general text,,0,0,0,,Gusto mo ba o hindi?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.22,1:12:00.97,pangkalahatang text,,0,0,0,,Pagkatapos ay tulungan mo ako
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.22,1:12:03.72,pangkalahatang text,,0,0,0,,akyat doon
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.73,1:12:06.98,pangkalahatang text,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.06,1:12:10.31,pangkalahatang teksto,,0,0,0,,Dadalhin kita sa tuktok ng punong ito
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.69,1:12:56.78,preview,,0,0,0,,Kumusta ka kay Uka?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.86,1:12:59.53,preview,,0,0,0,,Kilala mo ba kung sino ang tunay kong ama?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.61,1:13:02.24,preview,,0,0,0,,Walang umaasa na lalaban ka sa kanya
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.32,1:13:05.45,preview,,0,0,0,,Ang susunod na hakbang ay maaaring maglalapit sa kanya sa kamatayan
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.53,1:13:07.66,preview,,0,0,0,,Alam ba ito ng iyong master?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.75,1:13:10.83,preview,,0,0,0,,Nakilala mo ba si Nak Soo noong bata pa?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.92,1:13:12.29,preview,,0,0,0,,Hindi ko alam ang pangalan o edad niya
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.38,1:13:14.25,preview,,0,0,0,, Tanging ang lugar kung saan kami tumingin sa mga ibon
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.34,1:13:15.88,preview,,0,0,0,,Hindi ko alam kung saan siya nakatira
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.96,1:13:18.13,preview,,0,0,0,,Dito nakatira ang pamilya Jin
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.21,1:13:20.97,preview,,0,0,0,,Ikakasal ang anak ni Mistress Jin
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.05,1:13:23.84,preview,,0,0,0,,Ano ang gagawin, guro? Magpakasal?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.93,1:13:26.64,preview,,0,0,0,,Hindi ko planong maging maid forever

